#: ../../ml/appendix/bayes_theorem.rst:5
msgid "ベイズの定理"
msgstr "Bayes’ Theorem"

#: ../../ml/appendix/bayes_theorem.rst:7
msgid "説明のために以下のような絵を考える。"
msgstr "To explain the theorem, consider the figure below."

#: ../../ml/appendix/bayes_theorem.rst:16
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"上図のマス内にある :math:`N_{ij}` は、「\\ :math:`X=i` かつ :math:`Y=j`\\ "
"」という事象が起きた回数を表すものとする。\\ 青く色が付いた部分の和を取れば「\\ :math:`X=3`\\ "
"」という事象が起きた回数になり、\\ オレンジ色の部分の和を取れば「\\ :math:`Y=2`\\ 」という事象が起きた回数となる。\\ "
"いま、全てのマスの総和を :math:`N` と表すと、「\\ :math:`X=i` かつ :math:`Y=j`\\ "
"」という事象が起こる確率は、\\"
msgstr ""
"Let the number :math:`N_{ij}` in each cell of the figure above count how "
"often the event “\\ :math:`X=i` and :math:`Y=j`\\ ” occurred.\\  Summing "
"the blue cells gives the number of times “\\ :math:`X=3`\\ ” occurred.\\"
"  Summing the orange cells gives the number of times “\\ :math:`Y=2`\\ ” "
"occurred.\\  If we denote the sum over all cells by :math:`N`, the "
"probability of the event “\\ :math:`X=i` and :math:`Y=j`\\ ” is given by "
"the formula below.\\"

#: ../../ml/appendix/bayes_theorem.rst:21
msgid ""
"P(X=i, Y=j) = \\frac{N_{ij}}{N}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"P(X=i, Y=j) = \\frac{N_{ij}}{N}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/appendix/bayes_theorem.rst:24
msgid ""
"と計算できる事になる。以上を踏まえ、つぎに条件付き確率を考える。\\ :math:`X=3` が起こったと知っているとき、\\ "
":math:`Y=2` が起こる条件付き確率 :math:`P(Y=2|X=3)` は、上図より"
msgstr ""
"Next, consider conditional probability. When \\ :math:`X=3` is known to "
"have occurred, the figure above gives the conditional probability that \\"
" :math:`Y=2` occurred, denoted by :math:`P(Y=2|X=3)`."

#: ../../ml/appendix/bayes_theorem.rst:27
msgid ""
"P(Y=2|X=3) = \\frac{N_{32}}{N_{X=3}}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"P(Y=2|X=3) = \\frac{N_{32}}{N_{X=3}}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/appendix/bayes_theorem.rst:31
#, python-brace-format
msgid "と計算できることがわかる。ここで :math:`N_{X=3}` は、上図の青い部分の和"
msgstr "Here :math:`N_{X=3}` is the sum of the blue cells in the figure above."

#: ../../ml/appendix/bayes_theorem.rst:33
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"N_{X=3} = \\sum_{j=1}^4 N_{3j}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"N_{X=3} = \\sum_{j=1}^4 N_{3j}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/appendix/bayes_theorem.rst:36
msgid "である。\\ :eq:`app-bayes1` を少し変形していく"
msgstr "We can now rearrange Equation \\ :eq:`app-bayes1` as follows."

#: ../../ml/appendix/bayes_theorem.rst:38
msgid ""
"P(Y=2|X=3)\n"
"= \\frac{N_{32}}{N_{X=3}}\n"
"= \\frac{N_{32}/N}{N_{X=3}/N}\n"
"= \\frac{P(X=3, Y=2)}{P(X=3)} .\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"P(Y=2|X=3)\n"
"= \\frac{N_{32}}{N_{X=3}}\n"
"= \\frac{N_{32}/N}{N_{X=3}/N}\n"
"= \\frac{P(X=3, Y=2)}{P(X=3)} .\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/appendix/bayes_theorem.rst:45
msgid "ここで、上図のオレンジ部分の和"
msgstr ""
"The following expression gives the sum of the orange cells in the figure "
"above."

#: ../../ml/appendix/bayes_theorem.rst:47
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"N_{Y=2} = \\sum_{i=1}^6 N_{i2}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"N_{Y=2} = \\sum_{i=1}^6 N_{i2}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/appendix/bayes_theorem.rst:50
msgid "を用いて :eq:`app-bayes2` をさらに変形する。"
msgstr "Using this sum, we rearrange Equation :eq:`app-bayes2` further."

#: ../../ml/appendix/bayes_theorem.rst:52
msgid ""
"P(Y=2|X=3)\n"
"= \\frac{N_{32}/N}{N_{X=3}/N}\n"
"= \\frac{(N_{32}/N_{Y=2})(N_{Y=2}/N)}{N_{X=3}/N}\n"
"= \\frac{P(X=3|Y=2) P(Y=2)}{P(X=3)}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"P(Y=2|X=3)\n"
"= \\frac{N_{32}/N}{N_{X=3}/N}\n"
"= \\frac{(N_{32}/N_{Y=2})(N_{Y=2}/N)}{N_{X=3}/N}\n"
"= \\frac{P(X=3|Y=2) P(Y=2)}{P(X=3)}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/appendix/bayes_theorem.rst:58
msgid "したがって、"
msgstr "Therefore, we obtain the following relationship."

#: ../../ml/appendix/bayes_theorem.rst:60
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"P(Y=2|X=3)\n"
"= \\frac{P(X=3|Y=2) P(Y=2)}{P(X=3)}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"P(Y=2|X=3)\n"
"= \\frac{P(X=3|Y=2) P(Y=2)}{P(X=3)}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/appendix/bayes_theorem.rst:64
msgid "という関係が成り立つことがわかる。これがベイズの定理である。"
msgstr "This is Bayes' theorem."

